meta {
  name: 07 (Alternative) Register All With Exchange
  type: http
  seq: 7
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/siteadmin/tenants/register-exchange
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{siteAdminToken}}
}

docs {
  Step 7 (alternative to step 4). Bulk-register EVERY tenant that has an
  `exchangeTenantId` but is not yet registered — the one-shot way to onboard all
  migrated tenants at once. Requires `system:config` (super_owner). Idempotent:
  already-registered tenants are skipped; per-tenant failures are counted, not
  fatal.

  Response `data`: `{ registered, failed, failures: [{ tenantId, error }] }`.
}
